I followed a path to a big lake.
I went right down to the shore.
There I walked a little way along the water.
Soon I came to an empty bench.
I sat down immediately.
I took my lunch from the morning out of the backpack.
I ate my Brötchen.
I also drank water from my bottle.
After that I stayed on the bench for a very long time.
I watched the small boats on the calm water.
A few people sailed on the lake.
Other people rowed in their boats.
I simply enjoyed the warm sun.
I almost fell asleep in the warmth.
Then a small bird flew next to me.
I quickly took a photo of the bird and the lake.
I am sending you the photo right now!
